The realistic 3D view of 2026-10-19 (sun shadow map, sky light, glass), removed
from the slice the same day to keep the editor lean; kept for a possible
extension. Apply from spikes/dynlex-bim-slice with patch -p1; it adds the
shaders mesh_shadow_vertex, mesh_instance_shadow_vertex, mesh_real_fragment and
mesh_real_cut_fragment, which then need compiling (overlay README).

