+            set shapeDraw to the item at shapeCursor in (scene's shapes's values)
+            if shapeDraw's glass = false:
+                cast gpu shadow of slot (bim gpu instance slot) from shapeDraw's first counting shapeDraw's count as instances from shapeDraw's firstInstance counting shapeDraw's instanceCount in context
+        cast gpu shadow of slot (bim gpu native slot) from 0 counting scene's nativeIndexCount in context
+
